      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In a comparative trial, buprenorphine 0-3 mg or morphine 10 mg was administered intramuscularly to patients post-operatively. The new drug buprenorphine produced more pain relief than morphine and appeared to have a longer duration of action. The side-effects produced by the two drugs were similar, as were the effect on respiratory and cardiovascular measurements."},
